Steve’s Tabernacle
- Get a Mixed Drink - $XXX
	if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
		do Inventory.add_item("Mixed_Drink")
	else:
		Not enough money
- Buy Galaxy Gas - $XXX
	if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
		do Inventory.add_item("Galaxy_Gas")
	else:
		Not enough money
- Ask for Shelter
	if {Global.is_catholic} == false:
		Yes
	else:
		No
- Flirt with Stacey
	if {Inventory.has_item("Cowboy_Disguise")}:
		Now have access to Stacey’s House
	else:
		No
- Ask the Bartender for Information - $XXX or Drink Mix
	- $XXX
		if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
			Yes
		else:
			Not enough money
	- Give Drink Mix
		if {Inventory.has_item("Drink_Mix")}:
			Yes
		else:
			You don't have a Drink Mix